{"slug": "practice-dsa-sort-characters-by-frequency", "title": "Sort Characters by Frequency", "source_url": "https://takeuforward.org/practice/dsa/sort-characters-by-frequency", "extracted_by": "live-ssr", "length": 7623, "code_blocks": 0, "images": 0, "html": "<div class=\"flex h-full min-h-0 w-full flex-col\"><div class=\"flex h-full min-h-0 w-full flex-col\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__wrapper\"><div class=\"scroll-fade-module__DRol_a__shell ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__scrollContainer\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__scrollable\" data-tufy-selectable=\"\"><header class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__header\"><h1 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__title\">303. Sort Characters by Frequency<span class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__titlePotdBadge\"></span></h1><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__metaRow\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__shortcutButtons\"></div></div></header><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__content\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText\"><p>You are given a string <strong>s</strong>. Return the array of <strong>unique</strong> characters, sorted by <strong>highest to lowest</strong> occurring characters.</p><p>If two or more characters have same frequency then arrange them in alphabetic order.</p></div><section class=\"mt-6\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle\">Example 1:</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1rem_1fr] gap-1\"><div aria-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"shrink-0 my-auto mx-auto bg-(--color-brand-primary-bg-3)\" role=\"separator\" style=\"width:1px;height:100%\"></div><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText\"><p><strong>Input :</strong> s = \"tree\"</p><p><strong>Output :</strong> ['e', 'r', 't' ]</p><p><strong>Explanation :</strong> </p><p>The occurrences of each character are as shown below :</p><p>e --&gt; 2</p><p>r --&gt; 1</p><p>t --&gt; 1.</p><p>The r and t have same occurrences , so we arrange them by alphabetic order.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mt-6\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle\">Example 2:</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1rem_1fr] gap-1\"><div aria-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"shrink-0 my-auto mx-auto bg-(--color-brand-primary-bg-3)\" role=\"separator\" style=\"width:1px;height:100%\"></div><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText\"><p><strong>Input :</strong> s = \"raaaajj\"</p><p><strong>Output :</strong> ['a' , 'j', 'r' ]</p><p><strong>Explanation :</strong> </p><p>The occurrences of each character are as shown below :</p><p>a --&gt; 4</p><p>j --&gt; 2</p><p>r --&gt; 1</p></div></div></section><section class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationSection mt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-x-2 justify-between w-full\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-x-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle mb-0!\">Now Your Turn!</h3><span class=\"body-b5-regular text-text-secondary\">Pick the correct output for the given input</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationExampleGrid\"><div aria-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"shrink-0 bg-border my-auto ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationExampleDivider\" role=\"separator\" style=\"width:1px;height:100%\"></div><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationExampleContent\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText\"><p><strong>Input :</strong> s = \"bbccddaaa\"</p></div></div></div><div aria-required=\"false\" class=\"grid w-full gap-2 ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionsGrid\" data-slot=\"radio-group\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"radiogroup\" style=\"outline:none\" tabindex=\"-1\"><label class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButton ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButtonDisabled cursor-pointer\" for=\"example-3-option-0\"><span class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer\" data-slot=\"tooltip-trigger\" data-state=\"closed\"></span><span class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionText\">['c', 'a', 'b', 'd']</span></label><label class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButton ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButtonDisabled cursor-pointer\" for=\"example-3-option-1\"><span class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer\" data-slot=\"tooltip-trigger\" data-state=\"closed\"></span><span class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionText\">['c', 'a', 'd', 'b']</span></label><label class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButton ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButtonDisabled cursor-pointer\" for=\"example-3-option-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer\" data-slot=\"tooltip-trigger\" data-state=\"closed\"></span><span class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionText\">['a', 'b', 'c', 'd']</span></label><label class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButton ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButtonDisabled cursor-pointer\" for=\"example-3-option-3\"><span class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer\" data-slot=\"tooltip-trigger\" data-state=\"closed\"></span><span class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionText\">['a', 'b', 'd', 'c']</span></label></div></section><div aria-label=\"Still unsure what the problem is asking ?\" class=\"ExplainProblemCta-module__pPRrwq__card\"><div class=\"ExplainProblemCta-module__pPRrwq__copy\"><p class=\"body-b6-semibold text-text-primary\">Still unsure what the problem is asking ?</p> <p class=\"body-b6-regular text-text-tertiary\">Let’s go through a few more examples, step by step, to make it clearer.</p></div></div><section class=\"mt-6\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle\">Constraints:</h3><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__constraintsBox\"><ul><li>1 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 10<sup>5</sup></li><li>s consist of only lowercase English character